       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      *****************************************************************
      * CABING02 - OCN/BAN VALIDATION AGAINST THE CARRIER MASTER      *
      * APPLICATION : CABS                                            *
      * INPUTS      : EDTIN   TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.EDITED(0)  CABSCDR   *
      *               CARRMST TELCABS.CABS.CARRIER  VSAM KSDS CABSCARR*
      * OUTPUTS     : VLDOUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.VALID(+1)  CABSCDR   *
      *               SUSOUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.SUSPENSE(+1) CABSERR *
      * CONTROL     : CTLOUT                               CABSCTL    *
      * BALANCE     : CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED +            *
      *               CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD                  *
      * RESTART     : FULL RERUN                                      *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                              *
      *   V1.00  1988-02-15  R.T.WHEELER  INITIAL OCN LOOKUP ONLY     *
      *   V1.10  1990-06-30  D.OKONKWO    ADDED BAN FORMAT EDIT       *
      *   V1.20  1993-11-02  J.M.CASTILLO ADDED EFFECTIVITY WINDOW    *
      *   V1.30  1998-04-19  P.NAIR       OCN CACHE ADDED - VSAM I/O  *
      *                                   WAS 40 PCT OF STEP CPU      *
      *   V1.40  2004-09-08  A.BUKOWSKI   BILLED-PARTY CHECK ADDED    *
      *   V1.41  2008-01-22  S.MARCHETTI  CACHE SIZE 10 TO 20 OCNS    *
      *   V1.50  2013-05-14  K.ADEYEMI    BAN CHECK-DIGIT VALIDATION  *
      *                                   ADDED FOR RBOC-STYLE BANS   *
      *   V1.51  2019-03-27  T.VANCE      RECOMPILE ONLY - LE V7 MIGR *
      *****************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID.    CABING02.
       AUTHOR.        RADIANT-DIGITAL-CABS-TEAM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  1988-02-15.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EDTIN   ASSIGN TO EDTIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-INPUT.
           SELECT CARRMST ASSIGN TO CARRMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY   IS CR-OCN
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-TABLE.
           SELECT VLDOUT  ASSIGN TO VLDOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
           SELECT SUSOUT  ASSIGN TO SUSOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-SUSPENSE.
           SELECT CTLOUT  ASSIGN TO CTLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EDTIN
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
           COPY CABSCDR.

       FD  CARRMST
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CABSCARR.

       FD  VLDOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  VLD-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(200).

       FD  SUSOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 300 CHARACTERS.
       01  SUS-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(300).

       FD  CTLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 180 CHARACTERS.
       01  CTL-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(180).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CABSWRK.

      * OWN WORKING STORAGE FOLLOWS - CABSWRK SUPPLIES THE STANDARD
      * SWITCHES, COUNTERS, ACCUMULATORS, FILE STATUS, ERROR CODES,
      * SUSPENSE LAYOUT, DATE WORK AREA AND CONTROL RECORD.
       01  WS-PGM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME             PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABING02'.

       01  WS-PARM-CARD-AREA.
           05  WS-PARM-RUN-ID          PIC X(12).
           05  WS-PARM-CYCLE-YYDDD     PIC 9(05).
           05  WS-PARM-RERUN-NBR       PIC 9(02).
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(61).

       01  WS-CACHE-CONTROL.
           05  WS-CACHE-COUNT          PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-CACHE-PTR            PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-CACHE-SUB            PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB        PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-CACHE-HIT-SW         PIC X(01).
               88  WS-CACHE-HIT        VALUE 'Y'.

      * LAST-20-OCN CACHE - AVOIDS A VSAM READ WHEN THE SAME OCN
      * REPEATS ACROSS CONSECUTIVE OR NEAR-CONSECUTIVE CDRS.
       01  WS-CACHE-TABLE.
           05  WS-CACHE-ENTRY OCCURS 20 TIMES.
               10  WS-CACHE-OCN        PIC X(04).
               10  WS-CACHE-ACTIVE     PIC X(01).
               10  WS-CACHE-EFF        PIC 9(05).
               10  WS-CACHE-EXP        PIC 9(05).
               10  WS-CACHE-TYPE       PIC X(01).

       01  WS-REC-VALID-SW             PIC X(01).
           88  WS-REC-VALID            VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-FAIL-ERR-CD              PIC X(04).

       01  WS-OCN-FOUND-SW             PIC X(01).
           88  WS-OCN-FOUND            VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-ACTIVE-OK-SW             PIC X(01).
           88  WS-ACTIVE-OK            VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-EFF-OK-SW                PIC X(01).
           88  WS-EFF-OK               VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-CONN-YYDDD-WORK          PIC 9(05).

       01  WS-BAN-WORK-AREA            PIC X(13).

      * CABS-STD-023 - BAN SCANNED AS A 13-CELL CHARACTER TABLE.
      * NO REFERENCE MODIFICATION IS USED ANYWHERE IN THIS PROGRAM.
       01  WS-BAN-TABLE REDEFINES WS-BAN-WORK-AREA.
           05  WS-BAN-CHAR OCCURS 13 TIMES
                                       PIC X(01).

       01  WS-BAN-SCAN-COUNTERS.
           05  WS-BAN-IDX              PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-ZERO-CNT             PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-BLANK-CNT            PIC S9(04) COMP.
           05  WS-NONNUM-CNT           PIC S9(04) COMP.

      * HARDCODED POSITION ASSUMPTIONS - BAN LAYOUT IS FIXED BY
      * TARIFF CONVENTION: 1-3 STATE, 4-6 RAO, 7-13 ACCOUNT.
       01  WS-BAN-STATE-GRP.
           05  WS-BS-CHAR OCCURS 3 TIMES
                                       PIC X(01).

       01  WS-BAN-RAO-GRP.
           05  WS-BR-CHAR OCCURS 3 TIMES
                                       PIC X(01).

       01  WS-BAN-ACCT-GRP.
           05  WS-BA-CHAR OCCURS 7 TIMES
                                       PIC X(01).

       01  WS-BAN-STATE-DISP           PIC X(03).
       01  WS-BAN-STATE-NUM REDEFINES WS-BAN-STATE-DISP
                                       PIC 9(03).
       01  WS-BAN-RAO-DISP             PIC X(03).
       01  WS-BAN-ACCT-DISP            PIC X(07).

       01  WS-BAN-VALID-SW             PIC X(01).
           88  WS-BAN-VALID            VALUE 'Y'.

      * VALID STATE-CODE TABLE - LOADED BY REDEFINES, NOT INITIALIZE.
       01  WS-VALID-STATE-CONSTANTS.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(24) VALUE '201202212213214215216217'.
       01  WS-VALID-STATE-TABLE REDEFINES WS-VALID-STATE-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-VS-CODE OCCURS 8 TIMES
                                       PIC 9(03).

       01  WS-STATE-SEARCH-SW          PIC X(01).
           88  WS-STATE-FOUND          VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-STATE-SUB                PIC S9(04) COMP.

       01  WS-CALL-PARM-AREA.
           05  WS-HASH-SEQ-IN          PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
           05  WS-HASH-OCN-IN          PIC X(04).

       01  WS-ABEND-CD                 PIC X(04).
       01  WS-ABEND-RSN                PIC X(40).
       01  WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT          PIC X(30).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       S000-MAINLINE SECTION.
       P0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM P1000-INIT THRU P1000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2000-PROCESS THRU P2000-EXIT
               UNTIL WS-EOF.
           PERFORM P8000-CONTROL THRU P8000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P9000-TERM THRU P9000-EXIT.
           STOP RUN.

       S100-INIT SECTION.
       P1000-INIT.
           PERFORM P1100-OPEN-FILES THRU P1100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1200-READ-PARM-CARD THRU P1200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1300-INIT-CACHE THRU P1300-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-EDTIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * OPEN SEQUENCE MATTERS - CARRMST MUST BE OPEN BEFORE THE
      * FIRST RANDOM READ IN P2240.  ABEND ON EDTIN OPEN FAILURE
      * ONLY - THE OTHER DDS ARE NOT CHECKED, CONSISTENT WITH THE
      * REST OF THE INGEST FAMILY.
       P1100-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT  EDTIN.
           OPEN INPUT  CARRMST.
           OPEN OUTPUT VLDOUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT SUSOUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT CTLOUT.
           IF WS-FS-INPUT NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'I001' TO WS-ABEND-CD
               MOVE 'CABING02 - EDTIN OPEN FAILED' TO WS-ABEND-RSN
               CALL 'CABABEND' USING WS-ABEND-CD WS-ABEND-RSN.
       P1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * PARMIN IS A SINGLE INSTREAM SYSIN CARD - RUN-ID, CYCLE YYDDD
      * AND RERUN NUMBER.  CABPARMR DOES THE ACTUAL SYSIN READ SO
      * THE CARD LAYOUT ONLY HAS TO BE MAINTAINED IN ONE PLACE.
       P1200-READ-PARM-CARD.
           CALL 'CABPARMR' USING WS-PARM-CARD-AREA.
           MOVE WS-PARM-RUN-ID         TO CT-RUN-ID.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME            TO CT-PROCESS-ID.
           MOVE WS-PARM-CYCLE-YYDDD    TO CT-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-PARM-RERUN-NBR      TO CT-RERUN-NBR.
           MOVE 1                      TO CT-STEP-SEQ.
       P1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CLEAR THE 20-ENTRY CACHE ONCE AT STARTUP.  RUNTIME REFILL
      * IS ROUND-ROBIN VIA WS-CACHE-PTR - SEE P2250-STORE-CACHE.
       P1300-INIT-CACHE.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-CACHE-COUNT.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-CACHE-PTR.
           PERFORM P1310-CLEAR-CACHE-ENTRY THRU P1310-EXIT
               VARYING WS-CACHE-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-CACHE-SUB > 20.
       P1300-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P1310-CLEAR-CACHE-ENTRY.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-CACHE-OCN (WS-CACHE-SUB).
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-CACHE-ACTIVE (WS-CACHE-SUB).
           MOVE ZERO   TO WS-CACHE-EFF (WS-CACHE-SUB).
           MOVE ZERO   TO WS-CACHE-EXP (WS-CACHE-SUB).
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-CACHE-TYPE (WS-CACHE-SUB).
       P1310-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S200-PROCESS SECTION.
      * CHECKS RUN IN A FIXED ORDER AND SHORT-CIRCUIT ON FIRST
      * FAILURE VIA GO TO - THE SUSPENSE RECORD CARRIES ONLY THE
      * ERROR THAT WAS DETECTED FIRST, NOT EVERY FAULT ON THE CDR.
       P2000-PROCESS.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD.
           PERFORM P2200-LOOKUP-OCN THRU P2200-EXIT.
           IF NOT WS-OCN-FOUND
               MOVE EC-OCN-UNKNOWN TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW
               GO TO P2000-EDTIN-NEXT.
      * 'A' = ACTIVE ON CR-ACTIVE-SW - NO 88 IS DEFINED ON THIS
      * FIELD IN THE FROZEN COPYBOOK SO THE LITERAL IS TESTED HERE.
           IF CR-ACTIVE-SW NOT = 'A'
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-ACTIVE-OK-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ACTIVE-OK-SW.
           IF NOT WS-ACTIVE-OK
               MOVE EC-TERM-EXPIRED TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW
               GO TO P2000-EDTIN-NEXT.
           PERFORM P2400-CHECK-EFFECTIVITY THRU P2400-EXIT.
           IF NOT WS-EFF-OK
               MOVE EC-TERM-EXPIRED TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW
               GO TO P2000-EDTIN-NEXT.
      * CR-BILLED-PARTY (I/C/R) - RESELLERS AND ILECS CANNOT BE
      * BILLED DIRECTLY THROUGH THIS CARRIER RECORD.
           IF NOT CR-BILLED-PARTY
               MOVE EC-OCN-UNKNOWN TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW
               GO TO P2000-EDTIN-NEXT.
           PERFORM P2500-VALIDATE-BAN THRU P2500-EXIT.
           IF NOT WS-BAN-VALID
               MOVE EC-BAN-UNKNOWN TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW.
      * FALL-THROUGH TARGET FOR EVERY GO TO ABOVE, AND ALSO THE
      * NATURAL NEXT STATEMENT WHEN ALL CHECKS PASS.
       P2000-EDTIN-NEXT.
           IF WS-REC-VALID
               PERFORM P2800-WRITE-VALID THRU P2800-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM P2700-BUILD-SUSPENSE THRU P2700-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-EDTIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2100-READ-EDTIN.
           READ EDTIN
               AT END
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW
               NOT AT END
                   ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT.
       P2100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * SUBSCRIPTED SEARCH OF THE 20-ENTRY CACHE FIRST; ONLY DROP
      * TO THE VSAM KEYED READ WHEN THE OCN IS NOT RESIDENT.
       P2200-LOOKUP-OCN.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-CACHE-HIT-SW.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-OCN-FOUND-SW.
           PERFORM P2210-SEARCH-CACHE THRU P2210-EXIT
               VARYING WS-CACHE-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-CACHE-SUB > WS-CACHE-COUNT
               OR WS-CACHE-HIT.
           IF WS-CACHE-HIT
               PERFORM P2230-LOAD-FROM-CACHE THRU P2230-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM P2240-READ-CARRMST THRU P2240-EXIT.
       P2200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2210-SEARCH-CACHE.
           IF WS-CACHE-OCN (WS-CACHE-SUB) = CD-OCN
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-CACHE-HIT-SW
               MOVE WS-CACHE-SUB TO WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB.
       P2210-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2230-LOAD-FROM-CACHE.
           MOVE CD-OCN TO CR-OCN.
           MOVE WS-CACHE-ACTIVE (WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB) TO CR-ACTIVE-SW.
           MOVE WS-CACHE-EFF (WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB)    TO CR-EFF-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-CACHE-EXP (WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB)    TO CR-EXP-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-CACHE-TYPE (WS-CACHE-HIT-SUB)   TO CR-TYPE.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OCN-FOUND-SW.
       P2230-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * KEYED READ ON CR-OCN.  A NOT-FOUND HERE IS A LEGITIMATE
      * BUSINESS OUTCOME (UNKNOWN OCN), NOT AN I/O ERROR - IT
      * ROUTES TO SUSPENSE RATHER THAN CABABEND.
       P2240-READ-CARRMST.
           MOVE CD-OCN TO CR-OCN.
           READ CARRMST
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-OCN-FOUND-SW.
           IF WS-FS-TABLE = '00'
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OCN-FOUND-SW
               PERFORM P2250-STORE-CACHE THRU P2250-EXIT
           ELSE
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-OCN-FOUND-SW.
       P2240-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2250-STORE-CACHE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-CACHE-PTR.
           IF WS-CACHE-PTR > 20
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CACHE-PTR.
           IF WS-CACHE-COUNT < 20
               ADD 1 TO WS-CACHE-COUNT.
           MOVE CR-OCN         TO WS-CACHE-OCN (WS-CACHE-PTR).
           MOVE CR-ACTIVE-SW   TO WS-CACHE-ACTIVE (WS-CACHE-PTR).
           MOVE CR-EFF-YYDDD   TO WS-CACHE-EFF (WS-CACHE-PTR).
           MOVE CR-EXP-YYDDD   TO WS-CACHE-EXP (WS-CACHE-PTR).
           MOVE CR-TYPE        TO WS-CACHE-TYPE (WS-CACHE-PTR).
       P2250-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CONNECT DATE MUST FALL WITHIN THE CARRIER'S EFFECTIVE
      * WINDOW.  BOTH SIDES ARE YYDDD SO A STRAIGHT NUMERIC
      * COMPARE IS SAFE WITHIN A SINGLE CENTURY - NO PIVOT NEEDED.
       P2400-CHECK-EFFECTIVITY.
           MOVE CD-CONN-YYDDD TO WS-CONN-YYDDD-WORK.
           IF WS-CONN-YYDDD-WORK < CR-EFF-YYDDD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW
           ELSE
               IF WS-CONN-YYDDD-WORK > CR-EXP-YYDDD
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW.
       P2400-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CABS-STD-023 - CHARACTER SCANNING OF THE BAN.  THE WHOLE
      * FIELD IS TALLIED FIRST, THEN WALKED CELL BY CELL WITH A
      * SUBSCRIPTED OCCURS TABLE.  NO REFERENCE MODIFICATION.
       P2500-VALIDATE-BAN.
           MOVE CD-BAN TO WS-BAN-WORK-AREA.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-ZERO-CNT WS-BLANK-CNT WS-NONNUM-CNT.
           INSPECT WS-BAN-WORK-AREA TALLYING
               WS-ZERO-CNT  FOR ALL '0'
               WS-BLANK-CNT FOR ALL ' '.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BAN-VALID-SW.
           IF WS-BLANK-CNT > 0
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-BAN-VALID-SW.
           PERFORM P2510-SCAN-BAN-CELL THRU P2510-EXIT
               VARYING WS-BAN-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-BAN-IDX > 13.
           IF WS-NONNUM-CNT > 0
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-BAN-VALID-SW.
           IF WS-BAN-VALID
               PERFORM P2520-CHECK-STATE-CODE THRU P2520-EXIT.
       P2500-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * HARDCODED POSITION ASSUMPTIONS: 1-3 STATE, 4-6 RAO, 7-13
      * ACCOUNT.  THIS MATCHES THE STANDARD WHOLESALE BAN LAYOUT
      * ONLY - THE ALTERNATE CONVENTION IS NOT DIFFERENTIATED HERE.
       P2510-SCAN-BAN-CELL.
           IF WS-BAN-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX) NOT NUMERIC
               ADD 1 TO WS-NONNUM-CNT.
           IF WS-BAN-IDX < 4
               MOVE WS-BAN-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX) TO WS-BS-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX)
           ELSE
               IF WS-BAN-IDX < 7
                   MOVE WS-BAN-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX)
                                    TO WS-BR-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX - 3)
               ELSE
                   MOVE WS-BAN-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX)
                                    TO WS-BA-CHAR (WS-BAN-IDX - 6).
       P2510-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * STATE-CODE GROUP MOVE - WS-BAN-STATE-GRP IS A 3-BYTE GROUP
      * OF INDIVIDUAL CELLS, NOT REFERENCE MODIFICATION.
       P2520-CHECK-STATE-CODE.
           MOVE WS-BAN-STATE-GRP TO WS-BAN-STATE-DISP.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-STATE-SEARCH-SW.
           PERFORM P2530-SEARCH-STATE-TABLE THRU P2530-EXIT
               VARYING WS-STATE-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-STATE-SUB > 8
               OR WS-STATE-FOUND.
           IF NOT WS-STATE-FOUND
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-BAN-VALID-SW.
       P2520-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2530-SEARCH-STATE-TABLE.
           IF WS-VS-CODE (WS-STATE-SUB) = WS-BAN-STATE-NUM
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-STATE-SEARCH-SW.
       P2530-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CABERRWR IS THE SHARED SUSPENSE FORMATTER/LOGGER - IT DOES
      * NOT PERFORM THE WRITE ITSELF, THAT STAYS LOCAL TO EACH DD.
       P2700-BUILD-SUSPENSE.
           MOVE WS-FAIL-ERR-CD  TO SU-ERR-CODE.
           MOVE 'E'             TO SU-ERR-SEVERITY.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME     TO SU-DETECT-PGM.
           MOVE 'P2000-PROCESS' TO WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT.
           MOVE WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT TO SU-DETECT-PARA.
           MOVE CT-RUN-ID       TO SU-RUN-ID.
           MOVE CABS-CDR-RECORD TO SU-ORIG-RECORD.
           MOVE SPACES          TO SU-FILLER.
           CALL 'CABERRWR' USING CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
           WRITE SUS-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT.
       P2700-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CABHASH ACCUMULATES THE RUN-WIDE SEQ AND OCN HASH TOTALS
      * USED FOR CROSS-STEP RECONCILIATION, NOT JUST THIS STEP'S
      * CONTROL RECORD.
       P2800-WRITE-VALID.
           WRITE VLD-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CDR-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-WRITE-CNT.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR TO WS-HASH-SEQ-IN.
           MOVE CD-OCN     TO WS-HASH-OCN-IN.
           CALL 'CABHASH' USING WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH WS-HASH-SEQ-IN
                                 WS-ACC-OCN-HASH WS-HASH-OCN-IN.
       P2800-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S800-CONTROL SECTION.
      * THIS STEP NEVER SUMMARISES OR CARRIES RECORDS FORWARD, SO
      * THOSE TWO COUNTS ARE ALWAYS ZERO AND THE EQUATION REDUCES
      * TO CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED IN PRACTICE.
       P8000-CONTROL.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME   TO CT-JOBNAME.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME   TO CT-STEPNAME.
           MOVE ZERO          TO CT-BILL-PERIOD.
           MOVE WS-READ-CNT   TO CT-READ.
           MOVE WS-WRITE-CNT  TO CT-WRITTEN.
           MOVE WS-REJECT-CNT TO CT-REJECTED.
           MOVE ZERO          TO CT-SUMMARISED.
           MOVE ZERO          TO CT-CARRIED-FWD.
           MOVE WS-ACC-MINUTES TO CT-HASH-MINUTES.
           MOVE WS-ACC-AMOUNT  TO CT-HASH-AMOUNT.
           MOVE WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH TO CT-HASH-SEQ.
           MOVE WS-ACC-OCN-HASH TO CT-HASH-OCN.
           IF CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED
                        + CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD
               MOVE 'B' TO CT-BAL-IND
           ELSE
               MOVE 'O' TO CT-BAL-IND.
           MOVE ZERO   TO CT-RC.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-ABEND-CD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-RESTART-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-FILLER.
           WRITE CTL-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CONTROL-RECORD.
       P8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S900-TERM SECTION.
       P9000-TERM.
           CLOSE EDTIN.
           CLOSE CARRMST.
           CLOSE VLDOUT.
           CLOSE SUSOUT.
           CLOSE CTLOUT.
       P9000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
